---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Appliance Repair Mooresville NC"
  description="Terms of service for Appliance Repair Mooresville NC website and services."
>
  <section class="py-12 lg:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">Terms of Service</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none space-y-6 text-gray-700">
        <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> November 2026</p>
        <p>By using this website or engaging our services, you agree to these terms.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8">Website Use</h2>
        <p>This website provides general information about appliance repair services in the Mooresville, NC area. Content is for informational purposes and does not constitute a binding offer. We may update or correct information at any time.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8">Service Engagement</h2>
        <p>Any service work is subject to a separate agreement formed when we schedule and perform work. Estimates, diagnostic fees, and repair authorizations will be discussed before work proceeds. Actual costs may vary based on findings after inspection.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8">No Guarantees on Website Content</h2>
        <p>While we aim for accuracy, we do not guarantee that all information on the site is complete or current. Service availability, pricing ranges, and response times can change.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8">Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, we are not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from use of this website. Our liability related to service work is governed by the terms agreed at the time of service.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8">Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of North Carolina, without regard to conflict of law principles.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8">Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms can be directed through the contact methods listed on our Contact page.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
